{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201830/extras/21fd9e393e30dc1f4371ae51820c17c9.poster.avif?t=1760436189\" width=616 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201830/extras/21fd9e393e30dc1f4371ae51820c17c9.webm?t=1760436189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201830/extras/21fd9e393e30dc1f4371ae51820c17c9.mp4?t=1760436189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the Warp is a roguelike deck-building game in space! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and add new cards to your arsenal and increase your chances of surviving. Explore procedurally generated systems and fight your way to the warp gate </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201830/extras/a03567daf0dca21351209cb7aaebdd34.poster.avif?t=1760436189\" width=588 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201830/extras/a03567daf0dca21351209cb7aaebdd34.webm?t=1760436189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201830/extras/a03567daf0dca21351209cb7aaebdd34.mp4?t=1760436189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter allies and foes, ancient civilization ruins, unlock powerful technologies and ships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>History:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You assembled a ragtag team for a dangerous trade route, but suddenly the nearest warp gate was destroyed. You have no option but to take the longest route and deliver your valuable cargo to make a hefty profit... Just survive and reach for the warp gate! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 ships, 120 play cards, 34 equipment cards </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore procedurally generated systems and fight your way to the warp gate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Encounter allies and foes, ancient civilization ruins, unlock powerful technologies and ships</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Discover and add new cards to your arsenal and increase your chances of surviving.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Pixelart by Kirokaze</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Synth-pop music made by Martyn Stonehouse</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Boss!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1201830/14ae465943472f921246a6890976a25e55a77a4b.jpg"},{"name":"Kill the Kingpin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1201830/0460a1d39891a341046ef57b28e6fc730083ff76.jpg"},{"name":"Kill the Mech","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1201830/7be8bbaf4bf44cd015afe024e4b08c50761a6e11.jpg"},{"name":"Hidden Treasure","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1201830/f420c74acdd35e7c38acc931f4cd554607bae5f9.jpg"},{"name":"You Win!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1201830/22a3f0995a2bf7cdb5363ce89b365a3c704e734d.jpg"},{"name":"Real Ending","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1201830/a8d8982e2e2aa3bf9ce233bed4494e9783ca8e22.jpg"},{"name":"Tempestra","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1201830/1007dc87069ccec119fc7fc943ccce06c350a1bf.jpg"},{"name":"Hard Mode","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommuni